# VERDICT 2026-09-04 04:55: MEASURED, NO GAIN — prefill 30k +3%, 100k +0.5..+1.6% (inside noise), decode
# -4..-6% at the low edge of the noise band. Not promoted; production keeps 8192
# (bench-results/2026-09-04-night-windows.md).
# Prefill chunk size 8192 -> 16384 (night of 2026-09-04). --max-num-batched-tokens bounds the
# tokens scheduled per step: a larger chunk means fewer steps per long prefill (less per-step
# overhead, larger MoE GEMMs) at the cost of activation memory on the head node
# (GPU_MEM_UTIL 0.85; 0.89+ was NV_ERR_NO_MEMORY). Boot-and-see: a failed boot shows within
# 15 min, then restart plain. Measure prefill 30k/100k and decode. Rollback: restart without TP4_ENV.
BATCHED_TOKENS=16384
